RSIKit search recipes adapt the local slick-bits AlphaEvolve, EoH, and DGM implementations.

The AlphaEvolve seed-all-islands and weaker-half reseeding policies derive from
FunSearch's program database, via slick-bits/alphaevolve:
https://github.com/google-deepmind/funsearch/blob/main/implementation/programs_database.py
